WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.142
This example inserts another Influenza admission
into the base table Then

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:12.252
it compares the live base-table count with the
stored materialized-view count The

00:00:12.266 --> 00:00:17.818
base table changes immediately The snapshot remains
unchanged

00:00:17.844 --> 00:00:23.483
because it has not been refreshed This demonstrates
staleness directly
